      "title": "No test covers the changed getUser behaviour",
      "description": "This change alters how getUser reads its param and what it returns. The repository has no test that exercises getUser. A test calling the route would have caught the broken param lookup. Without one, future regressions in this handler will also go unnoticed. Add a test that requests GET /users/1 and checks for a 200 status with a fetchedAt field. Add a second test that checks the 404 for an unknown id.",
